# Cosmic Ascension - Unreal Engine 5.8 project (guideline.md section 10.5)

# Build output, caches, local state (regenerated by the engine)
Binaries/
Intermediate/
Saved/
DerivedDataCache/
Plugins/**/Binaries/
Plugins/**/Intermediate/

# Build/ holds generated receipts; keep only platform resources (icons).
# Pak exclusions belong in Config/DefaultPakFileRules.ini (tracked); UE 5.8 treats Build/<Platform>/PakDenylist-*.txt as deprecated.
Build/*
!Build/*/
Build/*/**
!Build/**/*.ico

# IDE / generated project files (regenerate via "Generate Visual Studio project files")
.vs/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.sln
*.slnx
*.suo
*.user
*.opensdf
*.sdf
*.VC.db
*.VC.opendb
*.code-workspace
*.xcodeproj
*.xcworkspace

# Compiled artifacts (generated binaries are already covered by Binaries/ and Intermediate/;
# no global *.dll / *.lib / *.exe rule so that vendored third-party plugin binaries can be committed later)
*.obj
*.pdb
*.pch

# Baked lighting data (static lighting is disabled for this project)
*_BuiltData.uasset

# OS noise
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
